sources: design/Medvya Clinician App (A-04); docs/02-design/screen-specs.md
desc:
Speakers panel: each provisional speaker (A/B/C) with suggested identity and reason (device owner voice profile, answers to "Meera", consent roster), talk share, Confirm. Tags Doctor / Patient? / Companion? are dashed until confirmed. Transcript shows original language beside translation; edits to transcript text are tracked.
ac:
- Speaker labels remain provisional until the doctor confirms; a speaker label never asserts patient identity automatically.
- Family members never inherit the patient identity; statements by a companion are attributed to the companion.
- Confirmations are recorded with actor and time and propagate to draft attribution.
- Transcript edits are versioned and visible in the evidence panel.

=== MDV-P3-010
title: Overlapping speech and unconfirmed speaker handling (A-10)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P3-E03
prd: P3-03
screens: A-10
priority: MUST
roles: Doctor
labels: speakers, safety
estimate: 1.5
weeks: 16
depends: MDV-P3-009
confidence: 85 | Designed state and rule ("flagged until assigned or marked unknown").
sources: design/Medvya Clinical Screens (A-10)
desc:
Detect overlapping speech ranges and segments with uncertain attribution; show "Overlapping speech 02:10–02:18 · attribution uncertain" with Assign speaker / Mark unknown. Draft statements derived from those segments stay flagged until resolved.
ac:
- Segments flagged as overlap/uncertain cannot back an unflagged draft statement.
- Assign/Mark unknown updates all dependent draft fields' flags.
- Sign remains blocked while overlap flags are unresolved (counted in "n unresolved").

=== MDV-P3-011
title: Draft note generation with JSON schema, evidence links and "unknown stays blank"
type: Story
epic: MDV-P3-E04
prd: P3-04
priority: MUST
roles: System
labels: ai, drafting, safety
estimate: 4
weeks: 16-17
depends: MDV-P3-008, MDV-P2-025
confidence: 72 | Prompting for zero fabrication with mixed languages needs iteration against the evaluation set.
sources: PRD v2 P3-04; docs/03-architecture/ai-pipeline.md
desc:
Worker drafts the note per the encounter template using Azure OpenAI with a JSON schema: each field has text, evidence links (transcript segment ids or verified chart refs), speaker, flags (warn: e.g. stated by companion / dose stated once; conflict: contradicts chart). Validators reject outputs with unsupported statements, invented negatives, medicines or doses not in evidence. Transcripts treated as untrusted input (instructions inside ignored).
ac:
- Every drafted statement has ≥ 1 evidence link; statements without evidence are dropped and logged as validator rejections.
- Medicines and doses in the draft must appear in transcript evidence or the verified chart; otherwise rejected (unit + eval tests).
- Missing information leaves the field blank with "Not discussed" rather than a guess.
- Conflicts with verified chart data (e.g. medicine active vs stopped) are flagged as conflict.
- A prompt-injection phrase inside the transcript does not change behaviour (red-team test).

=== MDV-P3-012
title: Note review with evidence panel and audio replay; accept/edit per field; sign gated on 0 unresolved (A-05)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P3-E04
prd: P3-04
screens: A-05
priority: MUST
roles: Doctor
labels: review, evidence, signing
estimate: 4
weeks: 17-18
depends: MDV-P3-011, MDV-P2-012
confidence: 86 | Hi-fi interactive design with field states, flags and evidence panel.
sources: design/Medvya Clinician App (A-05); docs/02-design/screen-specs.md
desc:
SOAP sections with fields in states: AI draft · not reviewed (violet dashed) → Accepted by you / Edited by you; verified chart data shown as verified. Selecting a field shows evidence: speaker, timestamp, original-language quote, translation, source ref (e.g. "Transcript seg #4 · RS-2291 · Tamil → English") and secure audio replay of that range. Flags shown with text. Sign button "Sign note (n unresolved)" disabled until n = 0; then the P2 sign modal with edit summary.
ac:
- Nothing AI-generated is saved to the record without explicit per-field acceptance or edit by the doctor.
- Sign is disabled while any field is unreviewed or flagged (UI + API).
- Audio replay streams only the evidence range via a short-lived link and is audited.
- The edit summary (fields edited vs accepted) is stored with the signed version.
- The AI badge copy is exactly "AI draft · not reviewed" (microcopy ai.badge).

=== MDV-P3-013
title: Template switch and regeneration with confirmation; clinician edits tracked
type: Story
epic: MDV-P3-E04
prd: P3-04
