sources: PRD v2 P3-04; design/uploads/DoctorMate_Claude_Complete_UIUX_Wireframe_Prompt.md (regeneration confirmation)
desc:
Switching template or regenerating creates a new draft version; the doctor confirms because accepted/edited fields may be replaced (option to keep accepted fields). All clinician edits are tracked (field, before/after, time) for quality metrics (edit distance).
ac:
- Regeneration requires confirmation and never discards accepted/edited fields without an explicit choice.
- Draft versions are kept and linked to AI runs.
- Edit distance per field is computed for the ≥ 80 % minor-edits metric (MDV-P3-026).

=== MDV-P3-014
title: Pre-visit brief: verified chart facts visibly separate from AI summary (A-01)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P3-E04
prd: P3-05
screens: A-01
priority: SHOULD
roles: Doctor
labels: brief, ai
estimate: 2.5
