=== MDV-P3-016
title: AI unavailable → editable manual note with no data loss (A-06)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P3-E05
prd: P3-06
screens: A-06
priority: MUST
roles: Doctor
labels: resilience, fallback
estimate: 1.5
weeks: 16
depends: MDV-P3-007, MDV-P2-009
confidence: 88 | Designed state and microcopy.
sources: design/Medvya Clinician App (A-06 AI unavailable); design/Medvya Wireframes (A-06c)
desc:
If the AI service is down, slow beyond threshold or the job fails, show "AI drafting is unavailable right now. Your recording is saved." with Write manually and Notify me later. The recording remains stored for later drafting; the manual note works immediately.
ac:
- Simulated AI outage (feature flag / fault injection) shows the state within the timeout and loses no audio or typed text.
- "Notify me later" creates a notification when the draft becomes available.
- A later AI draft never overwrites manual content; it is offered as a separate draft to compare.

=== MDV-P3-017
title: Wrong-patient suspicion locks the session; re-binding needs a reason and is audited (A-09)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P3-E05
prd: P3-06
screens: A-09
priority: MUST
roles: Doctor
labels: safety, identity
estimate: 1.5
weeks: 17
depends: MDV-P3-008
confidence: 82 | Designed ("Different name heard"); detection heuristic is simple name matching and needs clinical review.
sources: design/Medvya Clinical Screens (A-09a); docs/03-architecture/state-machines.md (PATIENT_CHANGED)
desc:
If the transcript mentions a different patient name than the bound encounter, or the doctor reports a mix-up, show "Different name heard … Encounter is bound to {name}" with Stop & lock / It is correct. Stop & lock freezes the session; re-binding a recording to another patient requires a reason, creates a new encounter and consent check, and is audited.
ac:
- Stop & lock prevents further capture and drafting for that session.
- Re-binding requires a reason and a new consent for the correct encounter; both are audited.
- A recording can never be attached to two active encounters (constraint test).

=== MDV-P3-018
title: De-identified evaluation set and CI gate before any prompt or model change
type: Task
epic: MDV-P3-E06
prd: P3-07
covers: exit:1
priority: MUST
roles: Developer, Clinical advisor
labels: ai-quality, evals, ci
estimate: 4
weeks: 14-19
depends: MDV-P3-011
confidence: 70 | Building a representative synthetic/de-identified multilingual set takes clinical time.
sources: PRD v2 P3-07, exit 1; docs/03-architecture/ai-pipeline.md#quality-gate-p3-07-p6-05
desc:
tests/ai-evals: ≥ 50 synthetic/de-identified consultations covering code-switching (Hindi/English, Tamil/English), relatives' voices, noise, missing allergies, medication strengths, negation, interrupted recording, contradictions, report-to-patient mismatch. Python offline harness computes critical omission, unsupported assertion, speaker attribution, wrong-patient attach, dose error, fabricated medicines/doses. CI job runs on any change to prompts/models/schema and blocks merge on regression.
ac:
- Evaluation set exists with ground-truth notes reviewed by the clinical advisor; no real patient data.
- The CI gate runs automatically on prompt/model/schema changes and blocks on any fabricated medicine or dose (exit gate 1 requires 0).
- Metrics are reported separately, not as a single score, in an evaluation report.
- Evaluation results are versioned with prompt hash and model version.

=== MDV-P3-019
title: Audio retention purge and legal hold
type: Task
epic: MDV-P3-E06
prd: P3-07
priority: MUST
roles: System, Practice admin
labels: retention, privacy
estimate: 1.5
weeks: 18
depends: MDV-P3-006, MDV-P3-002
confidence: 85 | Policy default (30 days) and mechanism specified.
sources: PRD v2 P3-07; design/Medvya Enterprise Pages (H-06 retention); docs/04-security-compliance/README.md#retention-h-06-defaults-subject-to-legal-review
desc:
Scheduled job deletes audio chunks after the tenant's retention period (default 30 days) unless a legal hold exists; transcripts/drafts kept with the signed note. Deletion recorded (counts, ranges) without PHI. Blob lifecycle rules as backstop.
ac:
- Audio older than the retention period is deleted and the deletion is logged; held items are skipped.
- Evidence replay after deletion shows "Audio deleted per retention policy" while transcript evidence remains.
- Retention changes apply prospectively and are audited.

