estimate: 1
weeks: 19
depends: MDV-P3-018, MDV-P3-023
confidence: 85 | Deliverables explicit.
sources: PRD v2 P3 delivery package
desc:
AI safety card for clinicians (what the AI does/doesn't, how to read evidence and flags, never sign without review, how to report an AI incident). Waiting-room poster/notice explaining recording and the right to decline in English, Hindi and Arabic (plus Tamil for pilot). AI incident procedure (report, triage, disable flag, notify, root cause, evaluation set update). Evaluation report from MDV-P3-018.
ac:
- Safety card and notices reviewed by the clinical advisor and counsel and delivered to pilot clinics.
- AI incident procedure includes a kill-switch flag per tenant and is tested once in a tabletop.
- Evaluation report is attached to R3 release notes.

=== MDV-P3-025
title: Performance: draft ready ≤ 60 s (p50) after recording stops
